OL,3,GNEWSAMasterchef restaurateur wins
OL,4,Acouncil seating row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Masterchef finalist and
OL,7,Frestaurant owner said he believes he
OL,8,Fhas won his battle with Bradford
OL,9,FCouncil over outside seating it wanted
OL,10,Fhim to remove.
OL,12,FMatt Healy had threatened to end the
OL,13,Flease early on his Forde eaterie in
OL,14,FIlkley after officials claimed he had
OL,15,Fmade alternations to the premises
OL,16,Fwithout permission.
OL,18,FBut, following a public outcry and an
OL,19,Feleventh-hour meeting with the
OL,20,Fcouncil's letting agent, the seating
OL,21,Fnow appears set stay at the unit in the
OL,22,FMoors Shopping Centre.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
